          },
          "740841202": {
            "id": "740841202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Pahsiv? Where did you come from?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841203"
            ]
          },
          "740841203": {
            "id": "740841203",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Disappeared, Pahsiv.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841204"
            ]
          },
          "740841204": {
            "id": "740841204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright, sure, but get away from that vishap! It's dangerous!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841205"
            ]
          },
          "740841205": {
            "id": "740841205",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Good Paimon, Pahsiv! Danger, Melusine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841206"
            ]
          },
          "740841206": {
            "id": "740841206",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Pahsiv reaches out to stroke the vishap's head and the furious beast obediently lies down.\\nIt opens its mouth, coughs up a glittering drop of water, then jumps back into the water.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841207"
            ]
          },
          "740841207": {
            "id": "740841207",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Key, key, Pahsiv!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841208"
            ]
          },
          "740841208": {
            "id": "740841208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Woah. The vishap gave you the key when you asked for it. That was unexpected...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841209"
            ]
          },
          "740841209": {
            "id": "740841209",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Blue thing, good thing, key, protect.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841210"
            ]
          },
          "740841210": {
            "id": "740841210",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "By blue thing, you mean that vishap?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841211"
            ]
          },
          "740841211": {
            "id": "740841211",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Pahsiv!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841212"
            ]
          },
          "740841212": {
            "id": "740841212",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Was it helping you look after the key? Are you and the vishap friends?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841213"
            ]
          },
          "740841213": {
            "id": "740841213",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Pahsiv!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841214"
            ]
          },
          "740841214": {
            "id": "740841214",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Purple thing, steal key... Blue thing, fainted...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841215"
            ]
          },
          "740841215": {
            "id": "740841215",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "P—Purple thing? Who is that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841216"
            ]
          },
          "740841216": {
            "id": "740841216",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "#Purple thing, bad thing! Blue thing, Paimon, {NICKNAME}, good thing!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841217"
            ]
          },
          "740841217": {
            "id": "740841217",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Err... Okay. It all seems a bit odd, but it does seem like you're praising us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841218"
            ]
          },
          "740841218": {
            "id": "740841218",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Purple thing, very bad, Erinnyes, very Melusine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841219"
            ]
          },
          "740841219": {
            "id": "740841219",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, Paimon's never met a Melusine as unique as you... We thought Melusine all lived in the Court of Fontaine or Merusea Village. How come you're here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841220"
            ]
          },
          "740841220": {
            "id": "740841220",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Court of Fontaine? Merusea Village?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841221"
            ]
          },
          "740841221": {
            "id": "740841221",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You seem confused. Haven't you heard of those places?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841222"
            ]
          },
          "740841222": {
            "id": "740841222",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Court of Fontaine, Melusine... Merusea Village, Melusine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841223"
            ]
          },
          "740841223": {
            "id": "740841223",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Ah... Erinnyes, Pahsiv, home.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841224"
            ]
          },
          "740841224": {
            "id": "740841224",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Erinnyes, Pahsiv, protect!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841225"
            ]
          },
          "740841225": {
            "id": "740841225",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, you're saying that this is your home? And that you're protecting it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841226"
            ]
          },
          "740841226": {
            "id": "740841226",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Pahsiv!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841227"
            ]
          },
          "740841227": {
            "id": "740841227",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But don't the Melusine live in Merusea Village?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841228"
            ]
          },
          "740841228": {
            "id": "740841228",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes, that's kinda strange. Are some Melusine born elsewhere? Paimon can't see any others here though.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841229"
            ]
          },
          "740841229": {
            "id": "740841229",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Pahsiv, do you live here alone?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841230"
            ]
          },
          "740841230": {
            "id": "740841230",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Alone? Melusine. New Valet! Pahsiv!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841231"
            ]
          },
          "740841231": {
            "id": "740841231",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "New... Valet? There's a valet? Who?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841232"
            ]
          },
          "740841232": {
            "id": "740841232",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "#New... Valet! Paimon, Paimon, {NICKNAME}, {NICKNAME}. New Valet, New Valet!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841233"
            ]
          },
          "740841233": {
            "id": "740841233",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So who is New Valet, exactly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841234"
            ]
          },
          "740841234": {
            "id": "740841234",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Pahsiv... are you trying to say New Valet is called New Valet, like Paimon is called Paimon?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841235"
            ]
          },
          "740841235": {
            "id": "740841235",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Pahsiv!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841236"
            ]
          },
          "740841236": {
            "id": "740841236",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah-ha! I was right. Paimon's always said that she's clever, hasn't she?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841239"
            ]
          },
          "740841239": {
            "id": "740841239",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "New Valet, Pahsiv, knowledge, ka-pow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841240"
            ]
          },
          "740841240": {
            "id": "740841240",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Err... you mean that New Valet is helping you learn things?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841241"
            ]
          },
          "740841241": {
            "id": "740841241",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Pahsiv! Lots of. Language, wisdom... lots of.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841242"
            ]
          },
          "740841242": {
            "id": "740841242",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Er, Paimon's not sure about the \"lots of\" bit...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841243"
            ]
          },
          "740841243": {
            "id": "740841243",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Pahsiv, New Valet, protect, ka-pow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841244"
            ]
          },
          "740841244": {
            "id": "740841244",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And he helps you protect this place?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841245"
            ]
          },
          "740841245": {
            "id": "740841245",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Melusine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841246"
            ]
          },
          "740841246": {
            "id": "740841246",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You help him protect this place?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841247"
            ]
          },
          "740841247": {
            "id": "740841247",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Pahsiv!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841248"
            ]
          },
          "740841248": {
            "id": "740841248",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So that's it... But who is this New Valet? And why does he need you to help protect this place, anyway?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841249"
            ]
          },
          "740841249": {
            "id": "740841249",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Some bad things have happened here, too. We saw the stone tablet and how someone had scratched out the inscription. And we saw lots of filth... Was it all because of the purple thing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841250"
            ]
          },
          "740841250": {
            "id": "740841250",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Curious Paimon, Pahsiv! But time very not lots of.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841251"
            ]
          },
          "740841251": {
            "id": "740841251",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "Key, key, key, square, west, ka-pow, ka-pow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841252"
            ]
          },
          "740841252": {
            "id": "740841252",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We'll be as quick as we can!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841253"
            ]
          },
          "740841253": {
            "id": "740841253",
            "speakerId": 16210,
            "speakerName": "Pahsiv",
            "text": "#Paimon, Pahsiv! {NICKNAME}, Pahsiv!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841254"
            ]
          },
          "740841254": {
            "id": "740841254",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Pahsiv gives two happy jumps and then leaves in a bit of a hurry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740841255"
            ]
          },
          "740841255": {
            "id": "740841255",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It looks like we really are pressed for time. But we've already got two keys, so let's press on and get the third!"
          }
        }
      }
